">Figure 2. The same workflow with the Document Hub in place. The bookend p=
rocesses (inquiry intake and MRC approval) are deliberately unchanged from =
the pre-AI workflow; AI operates only inside the middle, under continuous h=
uman-in-the-loop control. The unchanged bookends are a subset of those that=
 preserve the regulatory posture.</li></ul><p class=3D"">We built this appl=
